  message: "2026-09-24: this row's python instance (urllib.request.Request under net_send) was adjudicated in INV-gujoh's pass (PR #1173). It is a WRONG row that is KEPT. Removing it withholds every clean verdict for a program that builds a Request, all 18 of hypergumbo's self-claims included, because urllib.request's I/O surface is not enumerated. The flow itself survives at urlopen. Blocked by WI-bakik (enumerate urllib.request). Not folded into INV-gujoh; the overlap is surfaced for the owner."  # 701f
